# Baseline ignores — ordinary tool/interpreter caches from working in this
# repo (running tools/*.py per AGENTS.md). Generated-deliverable ignores for
# deck/ live in deck/.gitignore (practice 8) since they're scoped there.

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Generated by tools/routing_eval.py --emit; regenerate rather than track
evals/routing/prompts/

# Written at session start by tools/precedent_session_practices.py: the
# practices in force from the TEAM and INDIVIDUAL sources. Untracked on
# purpose and not negotiable -- this repository is public, that text is not,
# and committing it would publish private practice content on the very
# commit that added the convenience. See that tool's docstring.
.precedent/
